  displayName: the photograph
  title: A PHOTOGRAPH
  body: 'Sarah, Emma and Leo at the trailhead, squinting into the sun.

    On the
    back, in Sarah''s handwriting:

    "Ranger station 7. Wait for us here."


    The
    station is empty. The door is gone.'
  objectiveAfter: Follow the trail east.
